---
import { quickstart, blob } from '../../data/site';
---
<section class="try" id="try" aria-labelledby="try-title">
  <header class="try__header">
    <div class="try__heading">
      <p class="badge">For developers</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="try-title">Try it on your computer.<br /><em>No phone company needed.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="try__lede">
      You need Docker and Go installed. A test phone runs in your terminal,
      so you need no account with a phone company.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="try__panel">
    <div class="term">
      <div class="term__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>terminal</span></div>
      <pre class="term__code" tabindex="0" aria-label="Quickstart commands"><code>{quickstart}</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div class="try__side">
      <p class="try__step"><span class="try__num">1</span><span>Clone the repository and set a webhook secret.</span></p>
      <p class="try__step"><span class="try__num">2</span><span>Start the gateway and the Fediverse tenant with Docker Compose.</span></p>
      <p class="try__step"><span class="try__num">3</span><span>Dial the demo shortcode from <code>cmd/ussdsim</code> in a second terminal.</span></p>
      <p class="try__more">
        To use a phone in your browser instead, connect a free Africa's
        Talking test account. See{' '}
        <a href={`${blob}/docs/telco-access.md`}>getting USSD access in practice</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
